@@ -37,19 +37,24 @@ workflows:
 
   - name: unit_economics
     category: finance
-    when_to_use: Understand real per-order profitability after Ozon fees.
+    when_to_use: Understand Ozon accruals and per-order economics using the current finance API.
     steps:
-      - operation_id: ozon_finance_transactions
-        why: Per-order accruals, commissions, logistics, returns (result.operations).
+      - operation_id: ozon_finance_accrual_by_day
+        why: Current daily accrual feed; use ozon_fetch_all with date + last_id="" for every page of one day.
+      - operation_id: ozon_finance_accrual_types
+        why: Decodes accrual type identifiers without guessing their business meaning.
       - operation_id: ozon_prices_get
-        why: Per-SKU commission percentages and current prices.
+        why: Current prices and commission reference per SKU.
     interpret: >
-      Net = sale amount − sales commission − logistics − returns − ads. Pull one
-      month at a time (API caps the window). Join transactions to SKU via
-      posting_number. Watch fbo vs fbs commission differences.
+      Pull each required calendar day separately. Sum total_amount using its currency,
+      retain unknown accrual identifiers instead of dropping them, and group posting-linked
